Gen 16:1 , Sarai, being barren, gives Hagar to Abram;
Gen 16:4 , Hagar, being afflicted for despising her mistress, runs away;
Gen 16:7 , An angel commands her to return and submit herself, promises her a numerous posterity, and shows their character and condition;
Gen 16:13 , Hagar names the place, and returns to Sarai;
Gen 16:15 , Ishmael is born;
Gen 16:16 , The age of Abram.
